  "title": "Coast Guard medevacs 91-year-old man from fishing vessel off San Diego",
  "description": "A Coast Guard Sector San Diego MH-60 Jayhawk helicopter crew, along with a San Diego Fire-Rescue Department Special Tactics and Rescue (STAR) Team paramedic, medevac a 91-year-old man from the fishing vessel Royal Star 25 miles south of San Diego Sept. 19, 2019. The man was in stable condition when he was transported to Scripps Memorial Hospital La Jolla. (Coast Guard video by Petty Officer 1st Class Patrick Kelley)",
